<title>UK: Votorantim to launch $300 mln 8-yr bond,put.</title>
<headline>Votorantim to launch $300 mln 8-yr bond,put.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian conglomerate Votorantim will launch a $300 million fixed-rate bond in the week of June 9, syndicate sources said on Friday. The bond will have an eight-year maturity with a put after five years. ING Barings is sole lead manager of the transaction.  </p>
<p>There is an investor presentation in London today.</p>
<p>Votorantim has interests in cement, paper, pulp, aluminium and nickel.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
